'''Akechi Mitsuhide''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] event. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]] increases health and Surge chance, grants [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]], and grants the Conjure [[Slow]].

